        "contractorTier": "INTERMEDIATE",
        "description": "About Athllo\n\nAthllo is a new sports technology startup building a platform that connects athletes with brands and sponsors. We're looking for an experienced full stack developer to build the first version of our MVP. This project has the potential to turn into a long term working relationship as we continue expanding the platform.\n\nProject Scope\n\nWe're looking for a developer to build a modern, responsive web application with a premium user experience.\n\nThe MVP will include:\n\nLanding page and marketing pages\nAthlete profile pages\nSponsor profile pages\nUser authentication\nAthlete and sponsor dashboards\nSearch and filtering functionality\nContact and inquiry forms\nStripe payment integration\nAdmin dashboard or CMS for managing content\nMobile responsive design\nDeployment to production\n\nThe design should be clean, modern, and premium with fast loading performance and excellent user experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile.\n\nPreferred Tech Stack\nReact\nNext.js\nTypeScript\nNode.js\nStripe\nPostgreSQL or Supabase\nTailwind CSS\nVercel (preferred)\n\nIf you believe another modern stack would better suit the project, we're open to recommendations.\n\nIdeal Candidate\n\nWe're looking for someone who:\n\nHas experience building SaaS products or marketplace platforms\nHas strong React and Next.js experience\nHas implemented Stripe payments before\nWrites clean, maintainable, scalable code\nCommunicates clearly and provides regular progress updates\nCan make thoughtful technical recommendations when appropriate\nTo Apply\n\nPlease include:\n\nLinks to 2 to 4 similar projects you've built.\nA brief description of your experience with React, Next.js, and Stripe.\nYour estimated timeline for completing this MVP.\nAny recommendations you have that could improve the product.\n\nWe're looking for someone who can become a long term development partner as Athllo grows, so future work is very likely for the right person.",
